  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add diced onion and cook for 3-4 minutes until softened.",
    "Add diced red bell pepper and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Add ground allspice, cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add 1 cup lentils, 2 tbsp tomato paste, 2 tbsp apple cider vinegar, and 1 cup coconut milk. Stir well.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 20-25 minutes, or until lentils are tender.",
    "Stir in 1 cup diced tomatoes and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro or scallions if desired."
